1
00:01:34,358 --> 00:01:36,161
The Principality of Zeon

2
00:01:36,201 --> 00:01:39,646
A gigantic space
citystate floating beyond the moon

3
00:01:39,686 --> 00:01:42,250
Is dominated by
the Zabi royal family

4
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:45,655
Who are determined to control all of humanity

5
00:01:45,856 --> 00:01:47,819
Attempting to
bring down their dictatorship

6
00:01:47,859 --> 00:01:49,983
The Earth Federation has fought relentlessly

7
00:01:50,023 --> 00:01:51,746
Against the
Zeons on Earth

8
00:01:51,786 --> 00:01:53,467
And in outer space

9
00:02:01,420 --> 00:02:02,140
Meanwhile

10
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:03,021
the White Base

11
00:02:03,061 --> 00:02:05,623
which had survived the attack of a Zeon space cruiser

12
00:02:05,663 --> 00:02:09,385
escaped from the
space colony side seven and descended to Earth

13
00:02:10,787 --> 00:02:12,147
The young crew

14
00:02:12,308 --> 00:02:14,229
unable to contact
Federation forces

15
00:02:14,269 --> 00:02:16,110
must continue fighting

16
00:02:16,191 --> 00:02:19,432
They must encounter one terror after another

17
00:02:26,518 --> 00:02:27,999
Coming home

18
00:02:44,050 --> 00:02:45,209
Here we go

19
00:02:53,008 --> 00:02:54,688
It's strange to
feel direct sunlight

20
00:02:54,728 --> 00:02:55,568
In the
space colony

21
00:02:55,608 --> 00:02:57,527
the lights
diffuse with mirrors

22
00:02:58,167 --> 00:03:00,607
I guess this
place is what they call nature

23
00:03:00,647 --> 00:03:01,447
Mere I？

24
00:03:01,487 --> 00:03:03,006
When people talk
of the open sky

25
00:03:03,046 --> 00:03:05,126
I suppose this
is what they mean

26
00:03:06,359 --> 00:03:07,120
Hey guys

27
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:07,801
seen Amuro？

28
00:03:07,841 --> 00:03:08,801
He went to
see his mother

29
00:03:08,841 --> 00:03:09,963
Kai，he'll be back

30
00:03:10,003 --> 00:03:11,764
So that's why I
saw the core fighter

31
00:03:11,804 --> 00:03:12,445
go figure

32
00:03:12,485 --> 00:03:13,325
He just left

33
00:03:13,365 --> 00:03:15,688
he said his hometown was about 30 kilometers away

34
00:03:15,728 --> 00:03:17,529
Well，I'm
disappointed in him

35
00:03:17,569 --> 00:03:19,251
Isn't he one of
Earth's elite？

36
00:03:19,291 --> 00:03:22,774
It's really unfair to say that everyone who happens to live on Earth's elite

37
00:03:22,814 --> 00:03:25,296
Amuro and his father stayed out in space for several years

38
00:03:25,336 --> 00:03:26,857
He's never really
lived with his mother

39
00:03:26,897 --> 00:03:28,859
so he's eager
to see her again

40
00:03:29,019 --> 00:03:31,981
Just having a
place on Earth makes you elite

41
00:03:32,021 --> 00:03:34,583
It seems like there have been a lot of air raids in this area

42
00:03:34,623 --> 00:03:35,263
doesn't it？

43
00:03:35,303 --> 00:03:36,864
I hope this
area is safe

44
00:03:36,904 --> 00:03:38,265
I do wonder

45
00:03:38,905 --> 00:03:40,787
There's been some
guerilla fighting

46
00:03:40,827 --> 00:03:42,147
so I hear

47
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:49,032
I couldn't possibly imagine you getting hurt

48
00:03:49,072 --> 00:03:50,032
mother

49
00:04:10,251 --> 00:04:13,095
Let's have
another round

50
00:04:28,086 --> 00:04:30,687
Huh？Who are you
kid？

51
00:04:30,727 --> 00:04:32,248
This is my house

52
00:04:32,288 --> 00:04:32,928
What？

53
00:04:32,968 --> 00:04:33,969
Stop

54
00:04:34,009 --> 00:04:35,569
But this brat
wasn't very…

55
00:04:35,609 --> 00:04:36,449
Ah，shoot

56
00:04:36,489 --> 00:04:37,690
it's empty

57
00:04:38,410 --> 00:04:39,170
Sorry

58
00:04:39,210 --> 00:04:41,011
we entered your
house without permission

59
00:04:41,051 --> 00:04:42,172
but there
was no one here

60
00:04:42,212 --> 00:04:42,932
kid

61
00:04:42,972 --> 00:04:44,532
Nobody was here？

62
00:04:44,572 --> 00:04:47,493
It's an
abandoned house

63
00:04:48,174 --> 00:04:48,694
What？

64
00:04:48,734 --> 00:04:49,974
You're lying

65
00:04:51,496 --> 00:04:52,537
Mother

66
00:04:52,577 --> 00:04:53,698
Mother？

67
00:04:54,179 --> 00:04:55,541
Mother，huh？

68
00:04:55,581 --> 00:04:57,183
He doesn't
believe me

69
00:04:57,223 --> 00:04:58,264
Mother

70
00:04:58,425 --> 00:05:00,987
Hey， maybe she
ran away from home

71
00:05:23,685 --> 00:05:24,886
If you need to
be with Amuro

72
00:05:24,926 --> 00:05:25,246
my dear

73
00:05:25,286 --> 00:05:27,326
you'll have to
come with us right now

74
00:05:27,527 --> 00:05:29,247
But going into
outer space is…

75
00:05:29,287 --> 00:05:32,929
You'd change your mind if you took one look at the remarkable construction of Asie

76
00:05:32,969 --> 00:05:34,729
I have to
show it to Amuro

77
00:05:35,089 --> 00:05:36,370
I understand that

78
00:05:36,410 --> 00:05:38,170
but I don't
think I can…

79
00:05:40,291 --> 00:05:41,291
Forgive me

80
00:05:41,331 --> 00:05:44,173
I could never get
used to living in outer space

81
00:05:44,213 --> 00:05:45,173
Amuro

82
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:55,352
喂，嘿，呢

83
00:05:55,392 --> 00:05:56,314
what's the matter？

84
00:05:56,354 --> 00:05:57,076
What's wrong

85
00:05:57,116 --> 00:05:58,198
little boy？

86
00:05:58,238 --> 00:05:59,880
Miss your mommy？

87
00:06:10,783 --> 00:06:12,265
Please pay me

88
00:06:12,867 --> 00:06:15,150
This is all we
have to live on

89
00:06:15,272 --> 00:06:16,312
Please

90
00:06:16,394 --> 00:06:18,717
pay me for
that apple

91
00:06:27,594 --> 00:06:28,555
Don't pick it up

92
00:06:28,595 --> 00:06:29,276
lady

93
00:06:29,316 --> 00:06:30,598
Don't pick it up

94
00:06:30,638 --> 00:06:31,279
The soldier

95
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:32,841
he'll pick it up

96
00:06:32,962 --> 00:06:33,563
Who's that？

97
00:06:33,603 --> 00:06:34,323
Oh

98
00:06:35,205 --> 00:06:36,848
hey，that boy

99
00:06:36,888 --> 00:06:38,490
I'll say
that to my face

100
00:06:38,530 --> 00:06:39,450
kid

101
00:06:39,692 --> 00:06:41,014
I said pick
up the coin

102
00:06:41,054 --> 00:06:42,256
and I meant it

103
00:06:42,296 --> 00:06:43,777
You little…

104
00:06:51,682 --> 00:06:53,203
What do you know？

105
00:06:53,604 --> 00:06:55,167
If we wasn't here
patrolling the area

106
00:06:55,207 --> 00:06:56,568
and protecting
people like we do

107
00:06:56,608 --> 00:06:59,532
this town would
have become Zion property a long time ago

108
00:06:59,572 --> 00:07:01,455
I remember，Amuro

109
00:07:01,495 --> 00:07:04,018
that boy is a
friend of my daughter's

110
00:07:04,739 --> 00:07:05,901
Please stop

111
00:07:05,941 --> 00:07:07,622
He's just a child

112
00:07:07,944 --> 00:07:09,105
What's that？
Stop what？

113
00:07:09,145 --> 00:07:10,467
I'll give you
back your money

114
00:07:10,507 --> 00:07:13,070
Please leave
that poor boy alone

115
00:07:19,245 --> 00:07:20,767
The soldiers
who survived

116
00:07:20,807 --> 00:07:23,169
were cut off
from the main force

117
00:07:23,891 --> 00:07:25,853
No one would come
and help when they needed it

118
00:07:25,893 --> 00:07:27,535
so that's what
happened to them

119
00:07:27,575 --> 00:07:28,496
Or so…

120
00:07:28,536 --> 00:07:29,457
it's so awful

121
00:07:29,497 --> 00:07:30,378
I see

122
00:07:30,659 --> 00:07:31,219
so…

123
00:07:31,259 --> 00:07:32,701
Komalie's gone？

124
00:07:32,741 --> 00:07:33,342
Yes

125
00:07:33,382 --> 00:07:34,583
my daughter and my…

126
00:07:34,623 --> 00:07:35,504
my husband

127
00:07:35,544 --> 00:07:37,226
I wish I could
feel grateful being alive

128
00:07:37,266 --> 00:07:38,707
but somehow I…

129
00:07:40,043 --> 00:07:40,363
So

130
00:07:40,403 --> 00:07:42,763
have you been
able to find your mother？

131
00:07:43,483 --> 00:07:43,963
But

132
00:07:44,003 --> 00:07:46,483
haven't you
gotten any letters from her at all？

133
00:07:46,523 --> 00:07:49,803
So you don't know
that she's a volunteer at the refugee camp？

134
00:07:50,563 --> 00:07:51,883
She's alive？

135
00:07:51,923 --> 00:07:52,723
Yes

136
00:07:52,763 --> 00:07:55,443
do you remember
the old church we used to go to？

137
00:07:55,483 --> 00:07:56,483
Behind the hill

138
00:07:56,523 --> 00:07:58,802
near the place
where you'd play with Komali？

139
00:07:58,842 --> 00:08:00,962
Oh，thank you

140
00:08:01,122 --> 00:08:02,882
Careful，please

141
00:08:02,922 --> 00:08:04,042
Armoro

142
00:08:10,092 --> 00:08:12,374
The enemy seems
to have completely retreated

143
00:08:12,414 --> 00:08:14,975
If no Federation
fighters come out to greet us soon

144
00:08:15,015 --> 00:08:16,456
Our guns will
start to rust

145
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:17,857
I'm crying

146
00:08:18,137 --> 00:08:20,179
This is Lagoon
3 reporting here

147
00:08:20,219 --> 00:08:21,139
Area 304

148
00:08:21,420 --> 00:08:22,300
no activity

149
00:08:22,340 --> 00:08:23,300
Roger

150
00:08:29,545 --> 00:08:30,906
All hands
return to ship

151
00:08:30,946 --> 00:08:32,267
Enemy
aircraft sighted

152
00:08:32,307 --> 00:08:34,508
Ready antiaircraft batteries

153
00:08:35,629 --> 00:08:36,070
Enemy？

154
00:08:36,110 --> 00:08:38,313
It's approaching
from ten kilometres out at sea

155
00:08:38,353 --> 00:08:40,515
And it's not
transmitting a friendly radio signal

156
00:08:40,555 --> 00:08:41,837
Mr， Bright
What should I do？

157
00:08:41,877 --> 00:08:43,159
Should I launch
the White Base？

158
00:08:43,199 --> 00:08:44,560
No，if we try to
move right now

159
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,042
they'll spot us
more easily，Miri

160
00:08:46,082 --> 00:08:46,803
That's true

161
00:08:46,843 --> 00:08:49,487
We can't afford
to have them call for reinforcements either

162
00:08:49,527 --> 00:08:51,369
We'll take the
initiative and shoot them down

163
00:08:51,409 --> 00:08:52,249
Right

164
00:08:52,490 --> 00:08:53,171
Core Fighter

165
00:08:53,211 --> 00:08:54,492
ready to launch

166
00:08:55,454 --> 00:08:56,375
You're
cleared for launch

167
00:08:56,415 --> 00:08:57,136
Core Fighter

168
00:08:57,176 --> 00:08:58,777
Proceed when
you're ready

169
00:08:59,739 --> 00:09:01,980
Roger，I'm off

170
00:09:06,584 --> 00:09:07,585
Something's coming

171
00:09:07,625 --> 00:09:08,546
Enemy？

172
00:09:08,586 --> 00:09:09,507
Looks like
a fighter

173
00:09:09,547 --> 00:09:10,908
Wait
he's behind us

174
00:09:10,948 --> 00:09:11,828
What？

175
00:09:11,869 --> 00:09:13,149
Too late

176
00:09:15,632 --> 00:09:16,752
Descend

177
00:09:44,259 --> 00:09:45,140
This is it

178
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:47,061
my mother
is down there

179
00:09:48,542 --> 00:09:49,463
Something's coming

180
00:09:49,503 --> 00:09:50,624
It looks
like an airplane

181
00:09:50,664 --> 00:09:51,585
you guys

182
00:09:51,625 --> 00:09:52,945
Let's go look

183
00:09:57,709 --> 00:09:59,671
Is it just my
imagination？

184
00:09:59,711 --> 00:10:01,712
Or do you see a
Federation fighter？

185
00:10:01,752 --> 00:10:03,033
That's
exactly what it is

186
00:10:03,073 --> 00:10:04,714
This isn't good

187
00:10:06,889 --> 00:10:07,812
Wow， cool

188
00:10:07,852 --> 00:10:09,857
that's a real
fighter plane

189
00:10:10,662 --> 00:10:12,306
Wait a minute， son

190
00:10:14,833 --> 00:10:16,633
You're a soldier
from the Federation

191
00:10:16,673 --> 00:10:17,073
right？

192
00:10:17,113 --> 00:10:18,993
I don't know the
reason why you've come here

193
00:10:19,033 --> 00:10:21,433
But could you do
us all a favour and hide that fighter？

194
00:10:21,473 --> 00:10:22,353
But why？

195
00:10:22,393 --> 00:10:23,313
I'm just
trying to…

196
00:10:23,353 --> 00:10:23,953
Well son

197
00:10:23,993 --> 00:10:27,193
your enemy's forward base is just beyond those mountains right over there

198
00:10:27,233 --> 00:10:30,473
And they come to
check us out almost every single day

199
00:10:30,513 --> 00:10:31,793
If they've
already seen you

200
00:10:31,833 --> 00:10:33,753
it could
create huge problems

201
00:10:33,793 --> 00:10:35,553
Could you hide
your plane for us please

202
00:10:35,593 --> 00:10:36,313
son？

203
00:10:36,353 --> 00:10:36,913
Yeah

204
00:10:36,953 --> 00:10:38,393
I'll do it
right now

205
00:10:39,756 --> 00:10:41,197
Is that Amuro？

206
00:10:43,562 --> 00:10:44,643
Amuro？

207
00:10:46,287 --> 00:10:47,408
Mother

208
00:10:49,653 --> 00:10:50,774
Amuro

209
00:11:00,347 --> 00:11:01,148
Mother

210
00:11:01,188 --> 00:11:02,068
阿莫羅，媽

211
00:11:23,762 --> 00:11:24,363
Excuse me

212
00:11:24,403 --> 00:11:26,528
could you please
take care of the fighter plane now？

213
00:11:26,568 --> 00:11:27,731
Yes，that's right

214
00:11:27,771 --> 00:11:28,533
Amuro

215
00:11:28,573 --> 00:11:29,856
go hide it quickly

216
00:11:29,896 --> 00:11:32,580
Then the two of
us can spend some time together

217
00:11:33,865 --> 00:11:35,067
I take it that
's your son？

218
00:11:35,107 --> 00:11:35,908
Yes

219
00:11:44,756 --> 00:11:45,797
Horrible

220
00:11:45,837 --> 00:11:49,001
I had no idea how
far the Zeons would go

221
00:11:49,843 --> 00:11:50,564
Then

222
00:11:50,604 --> 00:11:52,767
you don't
know that father…

223
00:11:52,807 --> 00:11:55,410
Hey

224
00:11:55,450 --> 00:11:57,412
two soldiers
are coming here

225
00:11:58,695 --> 00:11:59,616
Don't
move a muscle

226
00:11:59,656 --> 00:12:00,616
okay？

227
00:12:07,979 --> 00:12:08,900
咻，咻

228
00:12:33,186 --> 00:12:34,466
Watch this

229
00:12:35,147 --> 00:12:36,948
What kind of
fighter is that tailing us？

230
00:12:36,988 --> 00:12:37,869
I don't know

231
00:12:37,909 --> 00:12:38,509
Forward base

232
00:12:38,549 --> 00:12:40,310
this is hot dog
patrol reporting

233
00:12:40,350 --> 00:12:41,951
Enemy fighter
in our sight

234
00:12:41,991 --> 00:12:43,511
Position Y207

235
00:12:43,752 --> 00:12:45,353
Look，over there

236
00:12:45,393 --> 00:12:46,313
What？

237
00:12:48,354 --> 00:12:49,395
Gotcha

238
00:13:04,145 --> 00:13:05,465
Oh no
fuel is leaking

239
00:13:05,505 --> 00:13:06,826
it looks bad

240
00:13:10,067 --> 00:13:11,267
Listen，Bright

241
00:13:11,307 --> 00:13:13,508
They got my fuel
tank during the attack

242
00:13:13,548 --> 00:13:14,708
I hit one of
their planes

243
00:13:14,748 --> 00:13:15,668
but I lost it

244
00:13:15,708 --> 00:13:17,229
You can't
confirm it？

245
00:13:17,269 --> 00:13:19,469
No，I can't stick
around any longer

246
00:13:19,509 --> 00:13:20,309
Operator

247
00:13:20,349 --> 00:13:22,630
are you able to
figure out the enemy's flight path？

248
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:25,671
All I can tell you is that the enemy aircraft is heading southwest

249
00:13:25,711 --> 00:13:28,553
Which means the
plane is heading toward Amuro's hometown

250
00:13:28,593 --> 00:13:30,074
We must
contact him

251
00:13:30,114 --> 00:13:31,195
Listen up， Ryu

252
00:13:31,235 --> 00:13:32,476
can you get
back to the ship？

253
00:13:32,516 --> 00:13:34,038
That's no
problem at all，but…

254
00:13:34,078 --> 00:13:35,599
I'll have
Amuro do the rest

255
00:13:35,639 --> 00:13:37,079
Alright， over

256
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,081
Sailor

257
00:13:38,121 --> 00:13:40,202
send Amuro an
alert signal now

258
00:13:40,242 --> 00:13:41,443
Hurry，Sir

259
00:13:43,285 --> 00:13:44,445
Alright

260
00:13:44,686 --> 00:13:46,207
Everybody
stay put

261
00:13:46,247 --> 00:13:47,848
Nobody move now

262
00:13:55,225 --> 00:13:58,105
Isn't anyone in
this place gonna speak up？

263
00:13:58,145 --> 00:14:00,105
We heard that an
enemy fighter may have landed

264
00:14:00,145 --> 00:14:03,305
Anyone have any
information to back up this report？

265
00:14:03,625 --> 00:14:03,825
Hey

266
00:14:03,865 --> 00:14:05,625
did you happen to
see an airplane？

267
00:14:05,665 --> 00:14:06,905
You can
tell me，kid

268
00:14:06,945 --> 00:14:10,385
Don't be afraid
and just tell me exactly what you saw

269
00:14:12,385 --> 00:14:13,825
That's not nice

270
00:14:15,070 --> 00:14:16,310
Look， I
have chocolate

271
00:14:16,350 --> 00:14:19,150
Give me back
my mom and dad

272
00:14:20,430 --> 00:14:21,590
Too bad

273
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:23,629
you lost your
chance to have some chocolate

274
00:14:23,669 --> 00:14:24,989
Sorry， kid

275
00:14:28,789 --> 00:14:30,629
Where's that
noise coming from？

276
00:14:30,909 --> 00:14:33,709
How could they
page me at a time like this？

277
00:14:35,148 --> 00:14:37,268
Where's that
noise coming from？

278
00:14:38,388 --> 00:14:39,388
I don't know

279
00:14:39,428 --> 00:14:41,548
I'm 89 years old

280
00:14:45,571 --> 00:14:46,892
Hey，Ma'am

281
00:14:47,173 --> 00:14:49,096
Who's that in
that bed over there？

282
00:14:49,136 --> 00:14:50,418
Nobody，really

283
00:14:50,458 --> 00:14:53,142
just one of the
injured that I'm helping to take care of

284
00:14:53,182 --> 00:14:54,183
that's all

285
00:14:54,223 --> 00:14:55,344
Let's see

286
00:14:56,827 --> 00:14:57,508
He's my son

287
00:14:57,548 --> 00:14:59,309
and he's
badly injured

288
00:14:59,350 --> 00:15:01,873
Let's see if you
have nothing to hide

289
00:15:29,257 --> 00:15:30,257
阿莫羅

290
00:15:30,857 --> 00:15:31,937
阿莫羅？

291
00:15:40,941 --> 00:15:41,941
阿莫羅？

292
00:15:45,358 --> 00:15:47,438
It looks like
this soldier's still breathing

293
00:15:47,478 --> 00:15:48,878
Get a doctor

294
00:15:56,371 --> 00:15:59,851
Even those Zeons
could have children waiting for them at home

295
00:15:59,971 --> 00:16:00,731
You've…

296
00:16:00,771 --> 00:16:01,812
you've
grown so wild

297
00:16:01,852 --> 00:16:02,812
Almero

298
00:16:03,332 --> 00:16:04,532
I don't
even know you

299
00:16:04,572 --> 00:16:05,252
I…

300
00:16:06,852 --> 00:16:08,372
I can't believe
what you're saying

301
00:16:08,412 --> 00:16:08,932
Mom

302
00:16:08,972 --> 00:16:10,332
You'd rather
they got me？

303
00:16:10,372 --> 00:16:11,533
Would you
prefer that？

304
00:16:11,573 --> 00:16:12,093
It's war

305
00:16:12,133 --> 00:16:12,813
I…

306
00:16:13,333 --> 00:16:14,613
I know， but…

307
00:16:14,853 --> 00:16:16,173
It's not
right for my son

308
00:16:16,213 --> 00:16:18,373
to wave around
a gun like that

309
00:16:18,613 --> 00:16:19,853
Oh， Mom

310
00:16:20,013 --> 00:16:21,613
are you saying…

311
00:16:23,183 --> 00:16:24,663
Are you saying…

312
00:16:26,984 --> 00:16:28,944
You don't love me？

313
00:16:29,585 --> 00:16:30,905
How can you？

314
00:16:31,345 --> 00:16:34,466
How is it possible for a mother not to love her only son？

315
00:16:34,506 --> 00:16:36,066
You're a liar

316
00:16:36,627 --> 00:16:37,787
阿莫羅

317
00:16:41,988 --> 00:16:42,868
What's happened
阿莫羅？

318
00:16:42,908 --> 00:16:43,628
Uh

319
00:16:44,388 --> 00:16:45,109
nothing

320
00:16:45,149 --> 00:16:46,029
Right

321
00:16:46,109 --> 00:16:47,189
this is an
emergency

322
00:16:47,229 --> 00:16:49,870
A Zeon patrol
plane is headed your way

323
00:16:52,666 --> 00:16:53,827
Roger that，Sailor

324
00:16:53,867 --> 00:16:54,907
Amuro

325
00:16:55,268 --> 00:16:56,348
What's happened？

326
00:16:56,388 --> 00:16:59,270
You weren't raised to be such a terrible violent boy

327
00:16:59,310 --> 00:17:00,710
Why can't you
be more gentle？

328
00:17:00,750 --> 00:17:02,271
Like you
used to be

329
00:17:02,431 --> 00:17:04,112
Can't you accept…

330
00:17:04,232 --> 00:17:05,873
We're at war now

331
00:17:08,834 --> 00:17:09,675
You're so cold

332
00:17:09,715 --> 00:17:11,796
I'm ashamed to
call you my son

333
00:17:45,338 --> 00:17:53,864
Is that it？ I'll get you， Where do you think you're going？ Are you heading for a face？

334
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:09,720
Heads up

335
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:11,560
the recon plane
didn't make it back

336
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:13,160
Commence
antiaircraft fire

337
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,760
launch the doms

338
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:29,640
I missed them

339
00:18:39,239 --> 00:18:40,560
No way

340
00:18:45,408 --> 00:18:46,570
Got Perry？

341
00:18:46,610 --> 00:18:47,211
Great

342
00:18:47,251 --> 00:18:48,893
they brought
Gundam with them too

343
00:18:48,933 --> 00:18:49,854
Yeah

344
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:53,901
Hey，Amuro

345
00:18:53,941 --> 00:18:55,222
You wanna try
a new challenge

346
00:18:55,262 --> 00:18:56,984
and attempt a
midair conversion？

347
00:18:57,024 --> 00:18:57,745
What？

348
00:18:57,785 --> 00:18:58,785
Midair？

349
00:18:58,866 --> 00:18:59,827
Yeah

350
00:18:59,867 --> 00:19:02,030
A trial run
during battle should be fun

351
00:19:02,070 --> 00:19:03,231
Go，It's a bad idea

352
00:19:03,271 --> 00:19:04,032
Mr， Kai

353
00:19:04,072 --> 00:19:06,915
We just installed
the docking parts that Lieutenant Matilda brought us

354
00:19:06,955 --> 00:19:08,197
They haven't
even been tested

355
00:19:08,237 --> 00:19:10,920
You just heard
Amuro say he wants to try it in midair

356
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:12,521
So we better do it

357
00:19:19,572 --> 00:19:22,338
Maybe it's because I was never around all those years

358
00:19:22,460 --> 00:19:25,066
All I know is he
wasn't like this as a boy

359
00:19:26,978 --> 00:19:29,418
My little boy
wouldn't even hurt a fly

360
00:19:35,141 --> 00:19:36,462
Distance 50 meters

361
00:19:36,502 --> 00:19:37,902
Activate
docking searcher

362
00:19:37,942 --> 00:19:39,543
Laser searcher synchronized

363
00:19:39,583 --> 00:19:40,263
countdown

364
00:19:40,303 --> 00:19:45,145
5、4、3、2、1

365
00:19:45,465 --> 00:19:47,786
Gundam
module B released

366
00:19:49,067 --> 00:19:50,267
Core change

367
00:19:50,307 --> 00:19:51,748
Go for docking

368
00:19:56,193 --> 00:19:57,476
Done，good one

369
00:19:57,516 --> 00:19:59,839
Gundam
Module A released

370
00:20:02,367 --> 00:20:03,489
Kai，watch it

371
00:20:03,529 --> 00:20:05,492
I don't think it
's synchronised

372
00:20:34,945 --> 00:20:36,106
That's Amuro

373
00:20:36,146 --> 00:20:38,428
What in the world
is he doing out there？

374
00:20:38,589 --> 00:20:39,110
Well

375
00:20:39,150 --> 00:20:41,433
he's probably
going after the enemy base

376
00:20:41,473 --> 00:20:45,158
What's the point of using our valuable ammunition on that backwater base？

377
00:20:45,198 --> 00:20:46,199
And stupid Kai

378
00:20:46,239 --> 00:20:47,280
what was
he thinking？

379
00:20:47,320 --> 00:20:49,804
A midair docking
in front of the enemy without testing？

380
00:20:49,844 --> 00:20:51,886
It's a careless
waste of our resources

381
00:20:51,926 --> 00:20:54,970
You know we might
as well surrender to the Zeon forces right now

382
00:20:55,010 --> 00:20:56,252
Right
that's enough

383
00:20:56,292 --> 00:20:57,293
So you
think I'm wrong

384
00:20:57,333 --> 00:20:57,974
do you？

385
00:20:58,014 --> 00:20:58,814
No

386
00:21:09,010 --> 00:21:10,773
You don't
want to stay

387
00:21:11,256 --> 00:21:11,937
No，mom

388
00:21:11,977 --> 00:21:13,421
it's not like that

389
00:21:13,461 --> 00:21:16,747
I feel like I belong somewhere for the first time in my life

390
00:21:23,165 --> 00:21:24,685
You are
his mother？

391
00:21:24,805 --> 00:21:27,406
I want to thank
you for taking care of Amuro

392
00:21:27,486 --> 00:21:28,327
Not at all

393
00:21:28,367 --> 00:21:31,447
Amuro has saved
us on many occasions

394
00:21:32,168 --> 00:21:33,568
Oh yes，really？

395
00:21:33,608 --> 00:21:34,289
Earlier today

396
00:21:34,329 --> 00:21:37,170
Amuro did an impressive feat under difficult circumstances

397
00:21:37,210 --> 00:21:38,530
And we're all
proud of him

398
00:21:38,570 --> 00:21:39,530
I see

399
00:21:40,011 --> 00:21:40,851
Yes

400
00:21:41,171 --> 00:21:42,971
now that
coming Amuro…

401
00:21:43,732 --> 00:21:45,012
Well，we'll be
leaving shortly

402
00:21:45,052 --> 00:21:45,573
all right？

403
00:21:45,613 --> 00:21:46,413
Yes

404
00:21:52,122 --> 00:21:53,525
Goodbye，mother

405
00:21:53,565 --> 00:21:54,969
Take care
of yourself

406
00:21:55,009 --> 00:21:56,251
I gotta go

407
00:21:59,139 --> 00:21:59,982
Excuse us

408
00:22:00,022 --> 00:22:02,386
I'm honoured to
have your son in our unit

409
00:23:17,535 --> 00:23:21,937
The White Base crew aren't the only ones running short on weapons and supplies

410
00:23:21,977 --> 00:23:26,899
Chief Quarren's booby trap strategy is enough to bring terror to Amuro and the entire crew

411
00:23:26,939 --> 00:23:29,500
as they bravely
face off with Gundam

412
00:23:29,780 --> 00:23:32,341
Will Amuro
survive the assault？

413
00:23:33,782 --> 00:23:35,302
Mobile Suit Gundam

414
00:23:35,342 --> 00:23:39,584
Next episode：
Time Be Still

415
00:23:40,065 --> 00:23:41,865
Who will survive？

416
00:23:50,306 --> 00:23:51,346
阿姆羅

417
00:23:51,507 --> 00:23:55,350
振り向かないで
宇宙の彼方に輝く星は，阿姆羅

418
00:23:55,390 --> 00:23:57,111
お前の生まれた故郷だ

